                            <button type="button" id="refresh-category-printers" class="button">
                                🔄 刷新打印机列表
                            </button>
                            <span id="category-printer-save-status" style="margin-left: 10px;"></span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="description">直接在此处为每个分类选择打印机，未配置的分类将使用默认厨房打印机。</p>
